From: LoMo <lomo@aviumui.org>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 15:34:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add switchable Project Elixir style Control Center and System Blur

Implements a clean, decoupled second Quick Settings presentation layer
inspired by Project Elixir, switchable via Settings between Avium (Default)
and Elixir style. Retains 100% of the original Avium QS implementation.
Includes real-time frosted glass backdrop blur with low (15px default),
medium (30px), and high (60px) intensity levels.
---

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/org/avium/systemui/di/AviumSystemUIModule.kt b/packages/SystemUI/src/org/avium/systemui/di/AviumSystemUIModule.kt
--- a/packages/SystemUI/src/org/avium/systemui/di/AviumSystemUIModule.kt
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/org/avium/systemui/di/AviumSystemUIModule.kt
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ import dagger.Module
 import dagger.Provides
 import org.avium.systemui.aod.di.AviumAodModule
 import org.avium.systemui.chips.di.AviumChipsModule
+import org.avium.systemui.controlcenter.di.AviumControlCenterModule
 import org.avium.systemui.island.di.AviumIslandModule
 import org.avium.systemui.keyguard.AviumMusicLockscreenController
 import org.avium.systemui.lockscreen.di.AviumLockscreenModule
@@ -36,6 +37,7 @@ import org.avium.systemui.mistouch.di.MistouchModule
 @Module(includes = [
     AviumAodModule::class,
     AviumChipsModule::class,
+    AviumControlCenterModule::class,
     AviumIslandModule::class,
     AviumLockscreenModule::class,
     MistouchModule::class
